 {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le02ob07re2vid01", "id": 2, "text": "As of 2014, the population of India was 1.3 billion. In different parts of India, different languages are spoken. India has 15 major languages and 844 different dialects. English is the language for national, political, and commercial communication. Hindi is the national language and spoken by over 30% of the population. Other languages include Telugu, Urdu, Punjabi and Tamil."}, {"time": "", "image": "engenn6le02ob07re2vid01", "id": 3, "text": "The most dominant religion in India today is Hinduism. About 80% of Indians are Hindus. Hinduism is a colorful religion with a vast gallery of Gods and Goddesses. Hinduism is one of the ancient religions in the world, said to have developed about 5000 years ago."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "India is located in Southern Asia. It borders the Arabian Sea and the Bay of Bengal, between Myanmar and Pakistan. India is made up of 29 states and 7 territories. It is the seventh largest country in the world and the second most populated country in the world."}, {"time": "18700", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "As of 2014, the population of India was 1.3 billion. In different parts of India, different languages are spoken. India has 15 major languages and 844 different dialects. English is the language for national, political, and commercial communication. Hindi is the national language and spoken by over 30% of the population. Other languages include Telugu, Urdu, Punjabi and Tamil."}, {"time": "50500", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "The most dominant religion in India today is Hinduism. About 80% of Indians are Hindus. Hinduism is a colorful religion with a vast gallery of gods and goddesses. Hinduism is one of the ancient religions in the world, said to have developed about 5000 years ago."}], "video_src": "engenn6le02ob07re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}